# Workflow: Code Review

## 1. Review readiness
- Read `AGENTS.md` and relevant rules
- Ensure the change scope is clear
- Confirm tests are passing

## 2. Understand intent
- Read the PR or MR description
- Identify the goal and expected behavior

## 3. Code quality
- Check naming and structure
- Look for clear error handling

## 4. Testing coverage
- Ensure tests follow existing patterns
- Validate edge cases and regression coverage

## 5. Integration and safety
- Confirm compatibility with existing architecture
- Look for performance regressions
- Check for security concerns and secrets

## 6. Final checks
- Verify git history is clean
